WEBVTT

00:12:57.037 --> 00:13:00.954
And Janis created a clever strategy,
a one year exit plan.

00:13:01.079 --> 00:13:03.662
I basically created three simple steps.

00:13:03.704 --> 00:13:06.787
These are the things that I'm
going to do to, like,

00:13:06.912 --> 00:13:09.621
actually build myself up and give myself

00:13:09.621 --> 00:13:15.121
the courage to leave this
toxic relationship.

00:13:16.287 --> 00:13:21.829
The first point was that I was going
to build relationships outside of

00:13:21.829 --> 00:13:25.537
the company. So try to like
meet up with people

00:13:25.579 --> 00:13:30.121
and just build relationships with people
who can help me in whatever my next